# Files that belong in the repo but not on the package's public pub.dev page.
# .pubignore replaces .gitignore for publishing, so it must ALSO restate the
# build artefacts .gitignore covers, or they would start being published.
.dart_tool/
.packages
.pub/
pubspec.lock
build/
doc/api/
coverage/
*.iml
.idea/
.vscode/
.env

# Internal working records. changes.md and plans.md are the Malipopay
# repo convention, CLAUDE.md is agent context, and docs/plans holds planning
# notes. None of them documents the package for its users, and publishing is
# irreversible, so they stay out of the archive rather than being tidied up
# after the fact. This also settles pub's "rename docs/ to doc/" warning: the
# only thing under docs/ is a planning note, so it is excluded, not renamed.
CLAUDE.md
changes.md
plans.md
docs/
